			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the adult male protagonist from <Picture 1>: tousled reddish-brown short hair, facial scars, yellow technical jacket, black shirt, pendant necklace, dark cargo trousers, black combat boots, and metallic prosthetic left arm. Preserve his identity and costume. His existing boot thrusters remain functional.\n<Subject 2> is the adult female protagonist from <Picture 2>: red-and-blue high ponytail, black technical jacket, white high-neck top, harness straps, black pleated skirt, dark thigh-high legwear, mechanical leg armor, heavy boots, and white mechanical right forearm. Preserve her identity and outfit. Her electromagnetic rifle remains attached to its sling. Compact back-mounted modules unfold into paired cyan energy wings; these are mechanical projections, not biological wings.\n<Picture 3> defines the stormy cyberpunk skyline, towering architecture, elevated traffic, giant holographic displays, and blue-magenta neon.\nThe same black-hooded enemy wears a chest-mounted core concealed beneath the damaged front of the cloak. The core emits red light.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] A ten-second cinematic rooftop finale. The enemy stabilizes after being driven out of the alley, charging a red chest core as both protagonists close in. Their synchronized mechanical punch and electromagnetic beam overwhelm the core in a blinding collision. After a brief blackout, the enemy is gone. A red energy trace remains, and an enormous unidentified machine emerges as a silhouette within distant storm clouds.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1>: fully_preserved — retain his reference identity, outfit, left prosthetic arm, and established propulsion effects.\n<Subject 2>: fully_preserved — retain her reference identity, costume, and mechanical components, with the established rifle and deploying back-mounted energy wings.\n<Picture 3>: partially_preserved — retain the city atmosphere and skyline while relocating the action to an exposed rooftop above the deep street canyon.\n\ndetailed_description:\nTen seconds, vertical 9:16, photorealistic cinematic action. Continue the preceding fight's rain, lighting, equipment, and movement. The rooftop belongs to the same connected structure, high above the lower city streets; do not teleport the characters to an unrelated building. Wind drives rain across wet roof panels and trembling metal railings. Keep the enemy centered, the male protagonist approaching from the left, and the female protagonist from the right.\n\n[Shot 1] Begin in an ultra-wide rising view, continuing the enemy's backward momentum as the camera clears the alley walls and reveals the rooftop's height above the city. The enemy lands near the far side, skids through water, and rapidly regains balance. Red light builds inside the chest core, illuminating the parted cloak. The male protagonist follows with a short boot-assisted leap; the heroine uses her powered legs to clear the ledge just after him. Both land visibly, absorbing the impact, then spread into left and right flanking positions. A giant holographic city graphic flickers behind them; rainwater streams between roof panels. During the final second of this four-second shot, push toward the enemy's pulsing chest core while preserving the protagonists at the frame edges.\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:04.000, cut to a tight three-quarter view of the male protagonist's face and charging left arm. Golden electrical arcs gather around the prosthetic fist. Briefly slow the instant of full charge, then cut wide and return to full speed. On the opposite flank, the heroine's back modules unfold into two translucent cyan energy wings. Her forearm blade is retracted, and both hands grip the rifle.\n\nThey attack together: the male protagonist drives forward and punches the enemy's raised armored guard, pinning its upper body and opening a clear firing angle. The heroine simultaneously fires a concentrated cyan beam into the exposed red core from the other side, with the male protagonist outside the beam path. Red and cyan energy collide around the core while golden arcs flare at the fist's contact point. Roof panels crack locally, and rain flashes into vapor around the impact, creating a brief rain-free pocket. End with a short, intentional white exposure flare followed by a brief blackout immediately before 7 seconds.\n\n[Shot 3] At 00:07.000, emerge from black on a close view of the empty impact position. A faint red energy afterimage flickers just above the scorched roof, then weakens. The enemy has vanished; do not show a body. Pull back to reveal both protagonists still standing nearby, now side by side and alert. City neon returns as the combat glare fades. They exchange one quick glance, then look upward together. Continue pulling back and tilt slightly up, revealing an enormous, indistinct mechanical silhouette within distant high storm clouds. Show only fragments of its outline through cloud movement. Settle into a held final composition with rain, hair, and residual light still moving.\n\nMaintain readable geography, consistent weapon ownership, and coherent attack contact. No extra limbs, spontaneous costume changes, graphic injuries, subtitles, or watermarks. Limit overexposure to the brief climax transition.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nWind-driven rain, rooftop landing impacts, strained railings, and a rising red-core hum. Follow with prosthetic charging crackles, mechanical wing deployment, a heavy armored punch, and a concentrated electromagnetic discharge. The collision produces a deep explosive impact; sound drops sharply during the blackout. Return with subdued rain, faint residual electrical pulses, and a distant low mechanical resonance from the clouds. No dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A — no background music.",
